Z||000000||fierosound||12-30-1999||06:42 PM||||I found a power steering package for 84-87 Fieros in the Fiero Plus catalog (A Canadian outfit), but not listed at their website.  <A HREF="http://www.cyberus.ca/~fieropls/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cyberus.ca/~fieropls/</A> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Highway/2940/steer2.JPG"> <P>The kit is complete with everything needed including a customized steering shaft.  Cost is CDN$1915.00 (approx US$1365.00 depending on exchange)<P>For more info you'd have to email or phone/FAX them at (613) 596-6269<P><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 12-30-1999).]||||reg||14
